{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/9378","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/9378/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/9378/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/9378/events","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/9378","id":986884343,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU5ODY4ODQzNDM=","number":9378,"title":"DownloadRequest.toMediaItem always discards keySetId","user":{"login":"shilangyu","id":29288116,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5Mjg4MTE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29288116?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilangyu","html_url":"https://github.com/shilangyu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilangyu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilangyu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilangyu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilangyu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilangyu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilangyu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilangyu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilangyu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilangyu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":106814989,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDY4MTQ5ODk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"fc2929","default":true,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"marcbaechinger","id":584321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NDMyMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/584321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger","html_url":"https://github.com/marcbaechinger","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"marcbaechinger","id":584321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NDMyMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/584321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger","html_url":"https://github.com/marcbaechinger","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2021-09-02T15:32:57Z","updated_at":"2022-07-05T09:57:35Z","closed_at":null,"author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Problem\r\n\r\nThe method is defined as follows:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/blob/0ba317b1337eaa789f05dd6c5241246478a3d1e5/library/core/src/main/java/com/google/android/exoplayer2/offline/DownloadRequest.java#L225-L234\r\n\r\nHowever, `MediaItem.Builder` constructs the `MediaItem` in the following way:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/blob/02f7aafe67b4893134a31ea55a3ba0f0535df145/library/common/src/main/java/com/google/android/exoplayer2/MediaItem.java#L578-L588\r\n\r\nHence `drmKeySetId` is never applied because `drmUuid` was never set. This makes it confusing in the least. `.toMediaItem` should accept a DRM UUID to prevent this from happening, or `.toMediaItem` should never set `drmKeySetId` since it implies it has any significance.\r\n\r\n### Workaround\r\n\r\nNot using `.toMediaItem` and setting all values manually, like so:\r\n\r\n```java\r\nnew MediaItem.Builder()\r\n           .setMediaId(download.request.id)\r\n           .setUri(download.request.uri)\r\n           .setCustomCacheKey(download.request.customCacheKey)\r\n           .setMimeType(download.request.mimeType)\r\n           .setStreamKeys(download.request.streamKeys)\r\n           .setDrmKeySetId(download.request.keySetId)\r\n            // has to be added to overcome ignoring of `keySetId`       \r\n           .setDrmUuid(C.WIDEVINE_UUID)\r\n           .build();\r\n```","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/9378/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/9378/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}